    {
      "id": "techcon-gh-infrastructure",
      "title": "Techcon GH LLC \u2013 Infrastructure Deployment",
      "domain": "systems-engineering",
      "difficulty": "advanced",
      "description": "Review the requirements for Techcon GH LLC, build the environment on your own system, and use each section as the technical specification for the project. This project provides exact requirements, but it does not provide implementation steps.",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "Instructions",
          "summary": "Use this page as the project specification while you build the environment independently on your own system.",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "ordered-list",
              "title": "How to Use This Project",
              "items": [
                "Read the active section carefully before you configure the related part of the environment.",
                "Build the environment on your own system using the exact requirements listed in each section.",
                "Move between sections as needed while you design, configure, validate, and troubleshoot the environment.",
                "Treat the requirement tables, group design, folder structure, and policy settings as the required target state for the project.",
                "Use the <strong>Mark as Reviewed</strong> control when you are satisfied that a requirement area has been fully addressed in your build."
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "list",
              "title": "Project Design Standard",
              "items": [
                "This is a project, not a guided lab.",
                "The environment must be designed and implemented from the requirements only.",
                "The site provides the exact technical specification, but it does not provide click-path instructions or step-by-step procedures.",
                "You are expected to determine the appropriate order of work, tools, validation methods, and troubleshooting process."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Scenario",
          "summary": "Business and deployment context for the Techcon GH LLC environment.",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Techcon GH LLC is a technology consulting firm standardizing the infrastructure for its New York office. The current environment lacks centralized identity management, structured data access, and consistent system configuration."
            },
            {
              "type": "combo",
              "title": "Environment Summary",
              "rows": [
                {
                  "label": "Office Location",
                  "value": "New York"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Network",
                  "value": "172.16.1.0/24"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Domain Name",
                  "value": "techcongh.local"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Departments",
                  "value": [
                    "Sales",
                    "Marketing",
                    "Operations",
                    "Human Resources",
                    "IT"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "label": "IT Teams",
                  "value": [
                    "Network Operations Center (NOC)",
                    "Security Operations Center (SOC)",
                    "Datacenter Operations"
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "items": [
                "The completed environment must provide centralized authentication, structured directory services, secure file access, and consistent endpoint configuration.",
                "The infrastructure must support controlled access to shared departmental resources and role-based collaboration spaces."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
